			<instruction>Talk to a Magic Supplier</instruction>
			<journal_entry>If you are feeling hungry or maybe a bit weak, you might have wondered what it feels like to cook your own food. There are various foodstuff one can use in $[Skill.C.s_cooking_Description_NameSingular], including $[Resource.M.r_meat_NameSingular] and a variety of fish, but most importantly the basic food materials like $[Resource.P.r_potato_NamePlural], $[Resource.C.r_carrot_NamePlural], and $[Resource.O.r_onion_NamePlural], the famous miripoix. While $[Resource.P.r_potato_NamePlural] can be harvested from a  $[Resource.P.r_potato_plant_NameSingular], they can also be dug up using a $[Resource.S.r_shovel_NameSingular] pretty much anywhere, but you cannot just dig them up all the time. These basic food ingredients can also be found in $[Resource.F.r_food_crate_NamePlural] as well as some monsters. Now pick up that $[Resource.S.r_shovel_NameSingular] and give it a try.</journal_entry>
